<view class="page"
  ><view class="header"
    ><view class="eyebrow">FENEXT · PERSONAL KNOWLEDGE</view
    ><view class="title">欢迎回来</view
    ><view class="subtitle">在手机上继续你的知识积累。</view></view
  ><view class="notice"
    >当前使用真实个人测试账号。请先在桌面或网页创建账号；微信和短信登录需平台配置，尚未开放。</view
  ><view class="label">账号</view
  ><input
    data-field="username"
    bindinput="input"
    value="{{username}}"
    placeholder="个人测试账号"
  /><view class="label">密码</view
  ><input
    password
    data-field="password"
    bindinput="input"
    value="{{password}}"
    placeholder="登录密码"
  /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view
  ><button
    class="primary"
    loading="{{busy}}"
    disabled="{{busy || !username || !password}}"
    bindtap="submit"
  >
    登录并继续
  </button></view
>
